    "fullText": "acknowledgements A special recognition to my good friend Dr. — Rausse (hydrotherapy and nutrition); Jethro Kloss (herbal healer); Paul Twitchell (mapping the heavens); Darwin Gross (a true master); Dr.  Harvey Kellogg (detoxification), and T. C.  McDaniel, D. O.  (chemistry).  Special thanks to Brenda, Tony, Kathie, Theresa and Jennifer for all their help and valuable assistance in putting this information together in a cohesive form and for helping to keep our organization a true God company.  There are so many great healers and scientists that I couldn’t possibly mention them all.  I send my humblest apologies to those whom I did not mention.  A great healer or scientist is not swayed by humanity’s conditioning or monetary systems.  Rather, he or she forges ahead seeking truth so all can benefit."
