    "excerpt": "This gut tissue in the fetus later becomes the GI tract, thus creating a dynamic relationship between the GI tract and the rest of the body.  Because of this, it is vital that you clean and strengthen the GI tract in your detoxification program, that is, if you wish to have true success at regenerating your glands, as ...",
    "fullText": "and the like. — This gut tissue in the fetus later becomes the GI tract, thus creating a dynamic relationship between the GI tract and the rest of the body.  Because of this, it is vital that you clean and strengthen the GI tract in your detoxification program, that is, if you wish to have true success at regenerating your glands, as well as your whole body.  PINEAL GLAND The pineal gland is a small, flattened, cone-shaped gland located behind and just above the eyebrows (connected to the roof of the 3rd ventricle of the brain).  Scientific research hasn’t revealed much about this endocrine gland as of yet.  We know that it synthesizes melatonin, which is a hormone that relaxes you and aids in the sleep process."
