    "excerpt": "MODULE 2.9 The Muscular System CONNECTIVE TISSUE Connective tissue is a strong tissue, composed of collagen (protein) fibers, that forms organs, glands, tissues (muscles), etc. Connective tissue offers support, strength and form to cells and their respective tissues. Calcium is one of the main components, besides prote...",
