    "fullText": "parasites will naturally act upon this toxicity. — parasites will naturally act upon this toxicity.  Yet this natural response by your immune system to this toxicity and, of course, to the parasites who feed upon this toxicity, is oftentimes mistakenly called an autoimmune disorder.  Parasites and immune responses are always secondary to the cause; they are side effects of the symptom.  THIRD ROOT: OVERACIDITY—ACIDOSIS The body digests, absorbs, utilizes, reproduces, and eliminates in the presence of fluids.  These fluids include digestive juices, blood, extra- and intra-cellular fluids, lymphatic fluids and urine.  To fully understand the effects that food and toxins have within your body, however, you first have to understand opposites.  Creation exists because of the dynamic interplay of opposites, without which everything would be the same.  (Of course, because God is One, the closer to God you get, the more the opposites merge. ) The interplay between opposites creates movement, activity, shapes, sizes, colors, temperatures."
