    "excerpt": "You will begin to see a lot of mucus being discharged from the body.  This mucus can be clear, yellow, green, and even brown or black.  Occasionally you might find blood in the mucus.  Don’t panic.  This blood has been there a while.  Congestion is acidic and can cause inflammation and bleeding of tissue.  The throat c...",
    "fullText": "In this section we will examine each of these possible side effects. — You will begin to see a lot of mucus being discharged from the body.  This mucus can be clear, yellow, green, and even brown or black.  Occasionally you might find blood in the mucus.  Don’t panic.  This blood has been there a while.  Congestion is acidic and can cause inflammation and bleeding of tissue.  The throat can get very sore.  This is just mucus and toxins in the tissues trying to get out.  It is best not to use cough drops.  However, if you must, use only natural cough drops, like those made with Slippery Elm."
