    "excerpt": "There can be many swellings that erupt from the skin during detox.  Tumors can even become larger before they are dissolved.  Most swellings are short- lived, however, so it is important to keep up the fruit during these times.  Itching is another factor in detoxification.  This is mostly caused by a fungal or Candida ...",
    "fullText": "There can be many swellings that erupt from the skin during detox. — There can be many swellings that erupt from the skin during detox.  Tumors can even become larger before they are dissolved.  Most swellings are short- lived, however, so it is important to keep up the fruit during these times.  Itching is another factor in detoxification.  This is mostly caused by a fungal or Candida involvement.  An individual can develop itching and redness of the skin anywhere.  Remedies for Itching During Detoxification Angelica Root, Aloe Vera, or Chickweed applied topically can ease the itching.  If itching continues, the fungal infestation needs to be killed and the lymph they live in must be cleaned.  This requires herbal lymphatic and parasite formulas and a raw food diet.  OTHER SIDE EFFECTS DURING DETOXIFICATION Other side effects may include, but are not limited to: excessive menstruation; frequent or deep coughing; frequent urination; headaches; diarrhea; numbness; tingling of the arms, legs, hands and feet; skin eruptions and gas."
