    "fullText": "It depends upon the individual and how toxic he or she is. — A few people who have chosen to suppress their body’s need to cleanse itself (through steroids like prednisone) will have some deeper issues.  However, those who are more likely to experience the severe effects are the chronically toxic from birth, who manifest cancer, H. I. V.  and/or other serious illnesses.  TWO CASES OF CLEANSING Let’s examine two cases that exemplify the healing crisis.  Case 1 A thirty-six-year-old female with pancreatic cancer.  This was the degenerative type of cancer that shut her pancreas down.  Very little of any digestive activity was left."
