    "excerpt": "I also used liquid botanical extracts to enhance various organs and glands in her body, especially the pancreas.  I finally added solid foods starting with fruits, again because of their high energy levels and ease of digestion.  Finally in eleven months, she was cancer free!  Water Fasting This is the fourth and ultim...",
    "fullText": "I highly recommend this type of fast. — I also used liquid botanical extracts to enhance various organs and glands in her body, especially the pancreas.  I finally added solid foods starting with fruits, again because of their high energy levels and ease of digestion.  Finally in eleven months, she was cancer free!  Water Fasting This is the fourth and ultimate type of fasting.  Water fasts should only be done with R/O (reverse osmosis) or distilled water.  At this level, your digestive energy is totally given to the immune, lymphatic and glandular systems.  A water fast creates a high level of body cleansing and purging."
