    "excerpt": "Chlorophyll is another constituent that can be introduced into the colon via the enema method to assist the healing and cleansing process.  COFFEE ENEMAS — Many people use coffee enemas as these are very stimulating to the bowels and liver.  However, I never recommend them unless your colon is “locked” and you can’t ha...",
    "fullText": "I’m not against professional colonics. — Chlorophyll is another constituent that can be introduced into the colon via the enema method to assist the healing and cleansing process.  COFFEE ENEMAS — Many people use coffee enemas as these are very stimulating to the bowels and liver.  However, I never recommend them unless your colon is “locked” and you can’t have a bowel movement.  The continual use of coffee enemas has a whiplash effect causing extreme enervation of the colon and inflammation of the liver and kidneys."
