    "fullText": "stronger effect upon the body than single herbs. — stronger effect upon the body than single herbs.  There are many things to consider when combining herbs, such as compatibility, synergistic actions and effects to related tissues.  In Module 8. 3 I will suggest an ideal herbal tincture or blend for each of ten major conditions, including adrenal gland enhancement, parasite cleansing, and kidney and bladder functioning.  I n Module 8. 4 you will find the body systems listed once again (Cardiovascular, Digestive, etc. ), with suggestions for herbal detoxifiers and strengtheners for each system.  Finally, we will close with an important consideration of pharmaceutical antibiotics vs.  nature’s anti-parasitics in Module 8. 5 .  Have fun with herbs and herbal formulas, for their power and strength is much needed in today’s world.  With the use of herbs to clean and rebuild the body, vibrant health can be achieved by anyone who is willing to put his/her heart into it.  Do not be afraid of what God created for your use."
