    "fullText": "Number one in skin conditions of all types. — Scientific name : Iuscus aculeatus Parts used : Herb and rhizome.  Actions : Anti-inflammatory, aromatic, cellular proliferator, diuretic, laxative (mild), vasoconstrictor.  Cascara Sagrada A great herb in low dosages to strengthen the GI tract.  Helps tone and strengthen the intestines.  Increases and strengthens peristalsis.  Increases secretions of the liver, pancreas, stomach and intestines.  Strengthens the autonomic nervous system of the alimentary canal.  Use for constipation, but better used in a cleaning and rebuilding formula for the GI tract.  Helps clean and strengthen the liver.  Promotes bile secretion."
