    "excerpt": "If acid crystals or a toxic build-up affect the ending of this nerve, it can lead to heart palpitations, high blood pressure (when standing or walking), chest pain, etc.  This is true with all your organs and glands as the nerves that feed them also end in your hands and feet.  Rubbing the bottoms of your feet and the ...",
    "fullText": "Each color has its own special effect upon tissue. — If acid crystals or a toxic build-up affect the ending of this nerve, it can lead to heart palpitations, high blood pressure (when standing or walking), chest pain, etc.  This is true with all your organs and glands as the nerves that feed them also end in your hands and feet.  Rubbing the bottoms of your feet and the palms of your hands on a daily basis will break-up these crystals and toxic accumulations, relieving the symptoms.  Reflexology is an incredible science.  I have saved three individuals in cardiac arrest with the techniques of reflexology."
