    "excerpt": "One must consume and live with energies that are in harmony with one’s level of awareness.  These energies are contained in foods, thoughts, emotions, external influences, etc.  One’s level of awareness can change as one grows spiritually.  Any discord in these energies and dis-ease begins to settle in.  When an elemen...",
    "fullText": "All matter is condensed energy. — One must consume and live with energies that are in harmony with one’s level of awareness.  These energies are contained in foods, thoughts, emotions, external influences, etc.  One’s level of awareness can change as one grows spiritually.  Any discord in these energies and dis-ease begins to settle in.  When an element or form of energy is internal to your physical body, it is called an “endogenous field of energy. ” When it’s external to your physical body, it is called an “exogenous field of energy. ” There are, of course, endless bands and frequencies of energies."
