    "excerpt": "Detoxification the process of cleansing and alkalizing the body.  The removing of obstructions (e. g. , acids, mucus, parasites, chemicals, minerals, metals, thoughts and emotions) that block energy and the proper function of cells and the individual.  A necessary requirement in returning to vibrant health.  Detoxify 1...",
    "fullText": "Depressants sedatives. — Detoxification the process of cleansing and alkalizing the body.  The removing of obstructions (e. g. , acids, mucus, parasites, chemicals, minerals, metals, thoughts and emotions) that block energy and the proper function of cells and the individual.  A necessary requirement in returning to vibrant health.  Detoxify 1.  to remove the toxic quality of a substance; 2.  treatment of a toxic overdose of any medicine but especially of the toxic state produced by drugs of abuse or acute alcoholism.  Diaphoretic causes perspiration and increases elimination through the skin (Centaury, Coltsfoot, Sassafras).  Diastolic the second (or bottom) number in a blood pressure reading.  It is the blood pressure in the heart and arteries when the heart relaxes between contractions.  It is the pressure in your “pipes” (vascular system).  Digestants contains substances (i. e. , ferments, acids, enzymes and bitters) which aid in digestion of food (Coriander, Sage, Cinnamon)."
