    "excerpt": "About the Author Robert S.  Morse , N. D. , D. Sc. , I. D. , M. H. , is a board certified and accredited Naturopathic physician, a biochemist, iridologist, and a master herbalist.  Since 1974, he has owned and operated a Natural Health Clinic and God’s Herbs Botanical Company located in Port Charlotte, Florida.  Dr.  M...",
    "fullText": "About the Author Robert S. — About the Author Robert S.  Morse , N. D. , D. Sc. , I. D. , M. H. , is a board certified and accredited Naturopathic physician, a biochemist, iridologist, and a master herbalist.  Since 1974, he has owned and operated a Natural Health Clinic and God’s Herbs Botanical Company located in Port Charlotte, Florida.  Dr.  Morse teaches other physicians and healthcare practitioners the Art of Detoxification and Cellular Regeneration.  In his thirty years of practice, his groundbreaking work has helped thousands overcome cancer, diabetes, M. S. , Crohn’s Disease, Scleroderma, and other serious illnesses.  Dr.  Morse was a protégé of the late Dr.  Bernard Jensen, the “Father of the science of Iridology” in the United States, and a great advocate of living foods.  Dr.  Jensen referred to Dr.  Morse as “one of the world’s greatest healers. ” Robert Morse is a member of The International Association of Naprapathic Physicians and the American Naturopathic Medical Association."
