    "fullText": "Applying these suggestions demonstrates first- hand how raw plant foods work. — 95 | THE SUNFOOD DIET Recommendations For Rapid Results Before continuing on with more specifics on raw foods and health, I want to provide you with specific foods, juices and recipes to try now so that you may begin getting immediate results.  Applying these suggestions demonstrates first- hand how raw plant foods work.  All these foods, juices and recipes help detoxify our bodies while providing us with excellent nutrition.  All ingredients should be raw and organic!  For Increased Energy Blend: 5 oranges 3 tablespoons of flax seed oil Peel the oranges, but maintain the nutritious white pith.  Flax seed oil may be found in any natural food store.  Blend the oranges and flax seed oil together.  Do not bother removing the orange seeds as they are nourishing and contain anti-fungal qualities.  Drink slowly.  The fat in the flax oil allows the sugar in the oranges to release slowly over time.  This provides excellent energy over several hours."
