    "fullText": "100 j THE SUNFOOD DIET Or, if you are more active, try... — 100 j THE SUNFOOD DIET Or, if you are more active, try...  Juice: 3 apples 1 lemon 1 slice of ginger root Peel the lemon, but maintain the white pith.  Put all contents in the juicer.  If desired, warm this drink to 96° Fahrenheit (36 C).  The apples are \"soft\" on the throat and provide you with sugar as fuel.  Apples also contain pectin, which forms a gel in the intestines that helps remove toxins while simultaneously stim- ulating a bowel movement.  A bowel movement drains the lymph system, allowing lymphatic tissues throughout the body, including the tonsils in the throat, to alleviate any swelling.  Drink this juice 3-4 times a day until symptoms disappear.  For A Headache Juice: 4 ribs of celery 4 ounces of fennel 1 apple 1 orange Peel the orange, but keep the white pith intact.  Process all ingredients through a juicer.  Drink immediately.  Fennel is a wonderful, cooling, licorice- tasting herb.  The ancient Greeks and Romans used fennel to treat migraine headaches."
