    "fullText": "2 Exercise your skills in contrary thinking. — ) sitions are riddled with irreconcilable gaps, natural selection cannot form a new species, the fossil record contradicts the darwinian theory, there are no missing links, etc.  These truths indicate that the theory of evolution is fiawed and pred- icated on wrong assumptions.  Along with the elimination of evolutionary philosophies sold to us as facts, collapses a major philosophical basis for humanity's indulgent, disrespectful omnivorous and cooked-food diet.  Are we supposed to understand the theory of evolution to know how to eat?  Such a proposition is absurd on its face.  Eating naturally is an intuitive knowledge, a natural propensity.  It is easier to sneak up on lettuce than a rabbit.  Raw plant food stands as the obvious primary food of human beings.  We arrived on this spinning planet with a design to subsist mostly on raw plant food - and that is still our design now."
