    "fullText": "THE RESULT IS THAT OF PERPETUAL DISCORD BETWEEN MAN AND HIS ENVIRONMENT. — 758 I D ETOXIFICATION \"THE CONSTITUTION OF MAN'S BODY HAS NOT CHANCED TO MEET THE NEW CONDITIONS OF HIS ARTIFICIAL ENVI RON M ENT THAT HAS REPLACED HIS NATURAL ONE.  THE RESULT IS THAT OF PERPETUAL DISCORD BETWEEN MAN AND HIS ENVIRONMENT.  THE EFFECT OF THIS DISCORD IS A GENERAL DETERIORATION OF MAN'S BODY, THE SYMPTOMS OF WHICH ARE TERMED DISEASE. \" — Professor Hilton Hotema, Man's Higher Consciousness \"LONG-CONTINUED VIOLATION OF THE LAWS OF BEING IS THE CAUSE OF DISEASE; LONG-CONTINUED PERSEVERANCE IN OBEDIENCE IS THE ONLY MEANS BY WHICH HEALTH CAN BE RECOVERED. \" — Dr.  Herbert Shelton, Hygienic Review The Physiology Of Detoxification In a world given to superstition, we must always get back to basic simple concepts.  Over a lifetime of eating cooked foods, the body gets \"silted up. \" This silt consists of the residues of an improper breakdown of cooked food, the elements of which are spread throughout the body."
