    "fullText": "The tongue will become coated, the breath will turn foul. — They do not typically have harmful parasites on them, unless picked near contaminated water sources, or grown in soil saturated with toxic fecal matter.  The way to eliminate parasites is to stop taking in animal products of all kinds.  Only pure (preferably fresh spring) water should be introduced into the body.  Adopting The Sunfood Diet along with herbs, oxygen and taking special care to send \"hot\" foods through the digestive tract regularly, such as garlic, onions, hot peppers (cayenne), ginger and radishes, will help to eliminate parasites.  These foods may be mixed in juices (see Appendix C: Sunfood Recipes under Molotov Cocktail), or eaten whole with raw plant fats, such as walnuts.  Black walnut hulls have been used as a treatment for intestinal worms for thousands of years.  Colon hydrotherapy will also help flush parasites out of the system.  I have worked with people who have passed worms in excess of 1 foot (0."
