    "excerpt": "l68 DETOXIFICATION Gall Bladder Flush This flush dramatically increases liver function and bile flow as the bile ducts are a waste release area for the liver.  Once cleared, the liver can detoxify itself and excrete its waste properly.  This will assist the entire digestive system, and improve overall feelings of healt...",
    "fullText": "Once cleared, the liver can detoxify itself and excrete its waste properly. — l68 DETOXIFICATION Gall Bladder Flush This flush dramatically increases liver function and bile flow as the bile ducts are a waste release area for the liver.  Once cleared, the liver can detoxify itself and excrete its waste properly.  This will assist the entire digestive system, and improve overall feelings of health and well-being.  The gall bladder flush: 1.  Fast for three days on fresh, raw apple juice (preferably made from organi- cally-grown sour green apples or wild apples).  2.  During the evening of day three, suck on 15-20 cassia discs.  Cassia is a wild pod-fruit possessing powerful laxative qualities (contact www. sunfood. com or call 888-RAW-FOOD, if cassia is in stock it can be shipped to you).  3.  At 3:00 pm on day four, at least two hours after your last drink, break the fast with six to eight ounces (0. 25 liters) of organic stone-crushed and cold-pressed olive oil drank straight.  4.  Follow with six to eight ounces (0."
