    "excerpt": "I feel, through experience, that I know what the chal- lenges are with raw diets, what the solutions are and how we can experience the maximum amount of benefits with insurance for success.  Knowledge, we know, rests not upon truth alone, but also upon the under- standing of error.  Genesis 1:29 tells us to eat \"herbs ...",
    "fullText": "I have coached people over many years of eating raw plant foods. — I feel, through experience, that I know what the chal- lenges are with raw diets, what the solutions are and how we can experience the maximum amount of benefits with insurance for success.  Knowledge, we know, rests not upon truth alone, but also upon the under- standing of error.  Genesis 1:29 tells us to eat \"herbs and fruits\" but it does not tell us how much of each or which ones!  I know where the gaps are in the knowledge; this book is designed to fill those gaps."
