    "fullText": "• Laziness. — THE SECRET REVEALED Three Food Classes and the Effects of Overdose S YMPTOMS O F A C HLOROPHYLL O VERDOSE • Spaciness.  • Laziness.  • The feeling of being too passive.  • Feelings of being too cold (with the exception of wheatgrass juice which can make one feel too hot. ) S YMPTOMS O F A S UGAR O VERDOSE • Excessive urination.  • Light-headedness.  • Tooth sensitivity.  • Edginess.  Anxiety.  • Constipation.  • Sores in the mouth (this can be caused by a potassium overdose: eat sodium-residue foods, such as celery or kale, to help relieve this condition).  • Black circles under the eyes (adrenal exhaustion).  • Grogginess.  S YMPTOMS O F A F AT/ O IL O VERDOSE • Mucus elimination.  • Liver stagnation.  • Edginess.  • Sluggishness.  • Oily pores.  • Pimples.  • Constipation.  • Feelings of being too hot.  • Feelings of being \"hung over. \" • Strong body odor."
