    "excerpt": "Eating while traveling requires planning ahead.  Leverage your mind.  You have built within you the intuitive ability to intelligently set goals and think ahead.  Contact www. sunfood. com to pick up the book Healthy Highways by Nikki and David Goldbeck, which is a state-by-state directory of over 1,000 natural- a raw-...",
    "fullText": "In tropical countries fresh coconuts become a staple while traveling. — Eating while traveling requires planning ahead.  Leverage your mind.  You have built within you the intuitive ability to intelligently set goals and think ahead.  Contact www. sunfood. com to pick up the book Healthy Highways by Nikki and David Goldbeck, which is a state-by-state directory of over 1,000 natural- a raw-food restaurant (see the Raw-Food Restaurants section at the back of this book).  Take them to a park.  Without food in the way, you can conduct busi- ness quickly and efficiently - this will save you the expense and time in your day.  Another idea is to hire a raw-food chef to cater business meetings.  Check with your local raw-food restaurants or e-mail nature@sunfood. com to locate a raw-food chef in your area.  You have the most sophisticated computer in the world between your ears - use it!  Leverage your mind to figure out a way to redirect family events and busi- ness lunches to fit your dietary health habits."
