    "excerpt": "Imagine also, that as soon as the withdrawal symptoms began all the cigarette experts would get together and accost and attack anyone who did not smoke cigarettes for being nicotine deficient.  You are going to face peer pressure; it is part of the process.  All great endeavors have their challenges, or they wouldn't b...",
    "fullText": "In tropical countries fresh coconuts become a staple while traveling. — Imagine also, that as soon as the withdrawal symptoms began all the cigarette experts would get together and accost and attack anyone who did not smoke cigarettes for being nicotine deficient.  You are going to face peer pressure; it is part of the process.  All great endeavors have their challenges, or they wouldn't be great.  When people offer you toxic food, they may be projecting upon you their own lack of information or fears.  Let them know why you are making other choices."
