    "fullText": "Any cooked foods eaten should be properly combined. — 250 Ho« Initially, when you adopt The Sunfood Diet, you will most likely lose weight as your body detoxifies wastes ,t has accumulated over a lifetime.  Th,s is a nece!  KELT worry about embrace \" Rrst and f ' w ™ 42% FATS Fatty Fruits, Nuts, Coconuts, Seeds To Gain Weight center at 42:16:42 (Chlorophyll: Sugars : Fat) The inability to gain weight when eating raw plant foods may in some cases actually be caused by eating cooked-food.  Eating cooked starch (bread, cookies, pasta, rice, etc. ) with certain metabolisms actually promotes weight loss when one is significantly purified and has been eating 95%+ raw food for more than 6 months.  In some cases, when the body is at that level of purification, digesting cooked starch drains living water and vital energy, leaving one sallow.  The inability to gain weight when eating raw plant foods may also be due to an encrusted intestinal tract, which hinders food absorption and causes emaci- ation."
