    "fullText": "Fasting can draw out too many toxins at once and drain vital mineral reserves. — By stepping in at the critical moment and blocking this purge, injected chemical insulin forces the body to live with unacceptable sugars it can hardly tolerate, without being able to dismiss them.  To restore a healthy pancreatic condition, find the center in The Sunfood Triangle.  Use good sweet fruits (with seeds) to boost the blood sugar when you feel it is dropping.  Fats or protein (green vegetables, spirulina, hemp protein) can be used to thicken the blood if blood sugars rise too quickly."
