    "excerpt": "Trinity Springs Water is my personal favorite commercially available bottled spring water even though I am other than excited about the plastic bottling.  Other spring waters (such as high-end Grander water) bottled in glass are great.  Gardening By eating raw plant foods, I believe you will become deeply interested in...",
