    "excerpt": "The books and articles I have read on diet, spirituality and sex generally agree that between 25% and 40% of the life-force energy men accumulate from breathing, eating, Sunlight, spiritual power, etc.  is transmuted into sexual energy, which is stored physically in male sperm.  A single ejaculation contains 200 to 500...",
    "fullText": "The sex drive can be transmuted through the right use of diet. — The books and articles I have read on diet, spirituality and sex generally agree that between 25% and 40% of the life-force energy men accumulate from breathing, eating, Sunlight, spiritual power, etc.  is transmuted into sexual energy, which is stored physically in male sperm.  A single ejaculation contains 200 to 500 million sperm cells.  If we consider each sperm cell as a potential human being, there are sufficient sperm cells for a man in a few days to generate the current population of the Earth.  That is the power of semen.  Complementary to dietary considerations, there is a Taoist technique for redi- rection of the sexual energy called the \"big draw. \" This technique involves drawing back the discharge of sexual energy and redirecting it up the spine to the brain by drawing in the breath at the moment one is nearing sexual climax.  Through practice one can develop this retention ability."
