    "fullText": "The sex drive can be transmuted through the right use of diet. — The increase in sexual potency that follows is quite remarkable in that it creates great libido, more subtle sexual enjoyment, remarkable capacity and progressively increasing sensitivity.  For men, the point is to have sex, but not to ejaculate every time.  Sex is essen- tial to excellent health as it restores imbalances in the body chemistry, excites the sex hormones and balances the other major glands (the adrenal, thymus, thyroid, pituitary, hypothalamus, and pineal).  Sex clears the mind, frees the spirit and helps build a wonderful relationship with one's partner."
