    "fullText": "470 THE MYSTERY OF SEX TRANSMUTATION A healthy body is a sexual body. — 470 THE MYSTERY OF SEX TRANSMUTATION A healthy body is a sexual body.  Sexual people have a bountiful supply of attractive magnetism.  Two tuned beings consciously uniting their physical bodies invoke a powerful spiritual energy.  There is no substitute for spiritual sex.  Sharing pleasure and love unconditionally with another adds a new meaning to existence.  In my opinion, sex as a raw-foodist with a raw-foodist is a more amazing experience than anything I had known before.  How To Increase The Sex Drive \"HAVING SEX WITH ANOTHER IS USUALLY MORE PLEASURABLE IF THE PERSON SMELLS APPETIZING, TASTES AND LOOKS GOOD ()UST LIKE FOOD). \" - Joshua Rainbow, Biotrophic Protocol To increase the sex drive, eat nuts, seeds, wild coconuts, coconut oil, cacao, goji berries and maca.  Eating nuts and seeds stimulates the desire \"to go to seed! \" From personal experience I have found watermelon seeds to be quite an aphrodisiac."
