    "excerpt": "Optimally, I think it is excellent to move around the fat category eating macadamia nuts for several weeks, then olives for several months, eating some avocados, bringing in some durian, then pecans.  This is how I have come to eat raw plant fats.  This gives your body some variety and makes your diet easier on the dig...",
    "fullText": "The favorite food of raw-foodists all over the world: The Avocado. — Optimally, I think it is excellent to move around the fat category eating macadamia nuts for several weeks, then olives for several months, eating some avocados, bringing in some durian, then pecans.  This is how I have come to eat raw plant fats.  This gives your body some variety and makes your diet easier on the digestive organs, especially the liver."
