    "fullText": "446 I Do WHAT YOU LOVE TO DO Each one Reach back. — 446 I Do WHAT YOU LOVE TO DO Each one Reach back. Each one Heal lack. Each one Release strife, Each one Live more life! Be alive, Happily achieve. It's all yours If you believe. Each day Plan a way. Each night, Plan a site. That you will see When your dreams become Reality. Do WHAT YOU LOVE TO DO | 447 Each dawn Listen long To an uplifting book An enchanting song. Set the pace, Win the race, Give to all, A smiling face. Each life Touch deep. Bigger dreams Less sleep. Break bounds, Become the best. Leverage your mind Surpass the rest."
