    "fullText": "474 A MESSAGE TO ALL SUNFOODISTS laughing all have their place. — Let it dry another's tears, Until in heaven the deed appears, Please pass it on.  I want you to know that I feel tremendously fortunate to be the individual to bring this blessing to you.  It seems almost uncanny that such an opportunity would be entrusted upon me.  I would like to thank you for your interest in becoming all that you can possibly be.  Together we must carry the Sunfood Diet message forward.  Together we can turn this world into a paradise.  You, who have glimpsed your true potential, will be among the leaders of a new dispensation on Earth.  A MESSAGE TO ALL SUNFOODISTS \"WE, THE NEW, THE NAMELESS, THE HARD-TO-UNDERSTAND, WE FIRSTLINGS OF A YET UNTRIED FUTURE — WE REQUIRE FOR A NEW END ALSO A NEW MEANS, NAMELY, A NEW HEALTHINESS, STRONGER, SHARPER, TOUGHER, BOLDER, AND MERRIER THAN ANY HEALTHINESS HITHERTO."
