    "fullText": "526 ! 80/20 WEEKLY MENU FRIDAY BO/20 Breakfast 1 honeydew or sharlyn melon. — 526 !  80/20 WEEKLY MENU FRIDAY BO/20 Breakfast 1 honeydew or sharlyn melon.  2 young coconuts, with coconut meat and water blended together in a cream.  Add spirulina, hemp protein and 15 cacao beans.  If young coconuts cannot be found, blend one avocado with mature coconut water.  Lunch One smoothie containing: mango, orange and peach.  Add 2-3 tablespoons of olive oil if desired.  One sandwich made with toasted sprouted grain bread, avocado, lettuce, sunflower greens, sliced tomato and diced cucumber.  Cucumber, okra, zucchini, onion mixed salad.  Add organic, extra virgin, cold- pressed olive oil as dressing.  2 tangerines.  1 grapefruit.  Snacks 1 bowl of grapes (with seeds).  2 cherimoyas or white sapotes.  1-2 handfuls of goji berries.  Dinner Large salad containing 80% green-leafed vegetables including parsley, 2 avocados and blended papaya seeds, mango juice, lemon juice, hempseed and vinegar as dressing."
