    "fullText": "Patagonia is approximately one hour south of Tucson. — RAW FOOD RESTAURANTS ARIZONA TREE OF LIFE 771 Harshaw Road Patagonia, AZ 85624 520-394-2589 www. treeoflife. nu The Tree Of Life Rejuvenation Center has a raw-food restaurant open to the public.  Fresh foods directly from the garden are served in a delightful outdoor setting connected with nature.  Patagonia is approximately one hour south of Tucson.  RAWESOME CAFE (inside Gentle Strength Co-op) near the corner of University & Ash Tempe, Arizona Contact: Charlie Mort. Jim 480-496-5959 info@rawforlife. com www. rawforlife. com The Rawesome Cafe is on a mission to make raw-food cuisine more acces- sible by providing a central meeting place for like-minded individuals to gather.  CALIFORNIA ALIVE!  1972 Lombard Street San Francisco, CA 94123 415-923-1052 aliveveggie@sbcglobal. net A quaint raw-food restaurant to serve the growing need for delicious healthy dining experiences in the Bay Area."
