    "fullText": "Patagonia is approximately one hour south of Tucson. — Au LAC Gourmet Vegetarian Restaurant including Four-Course Organic Raw Vegan Dinner 16563 Brookhurst Street Fountain Valley, CA 92708 714-418-0658 www. aulac. com Chef Ito of Au Lac presents fantastic gourmet raw delights that carry the love and beauty that he emanates.  Au Lac's raw dessert menu is reason alone to visit.  Highly recommended.  You can feel the love in the food.  CAFE GRATITUDE 2400 Harrison Street San Francisco, CA (415) 824-4652 www. withthecurrent. com/cafe. htm Cafe Gratitude is a pure expression of a world of plenty.  The food and people are a celebration of aliveness.  They only select the finest organic ingredients to honor the earth and ourselves.  They support local farmers, sustainable agriculture and environmentally friendly products.  Their food is prepared with love."
