    "fullText": "At Cafe Gratitude you always enjoy nourishing yourself. — are invited to step inside and enjoy being someone who chooses loving your life, adoring yourself, accepting the world, being generous and grateful everyday.  At Cafe Gratitude you always enjoy nourishing yourself.  CAFE\" LA VIE 429 Front Street Santa Cruz, CA 95060 Contact: Yeyan Gunawan 831-429-ORGN www. lavie. us An organic, vegan, live food restau- rant in Santa Cruz, California!  The menu has a variety of dishes and flavors and the atmosphere is a bright and friendly with a tropical theme.  Events and raw-food cuisine classes are regularly held here.  CILANTRO LIVE!  315-1/2 3rd Avenue Chula Vista, CA 91910 619-827-7401 Fax 619-827-7403 www. cilantrolive. com Cristina and Guillermo Guzman operate this wonderful raw restaurant with hopes that you will stop in and try the incredible food.  Let your eyes, your taste buds, soul and your whole well-being decide how great food can be!  You will feel the difference!"
