    "fullText": "At Cafe Gratitude you always enjoy nourishing yourself. — COULEUR \"ALIVE\" CAFE\" 7820 Broadway Lemon Grove, CA 91945 Contacts: Chet, Elizabeth and Carlo Open from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM Monday through Saturday.  Sunday 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM.  Couleur \"Alive\" Cafe Welcomes you to an organic raw journey.  All of the organic raw foods are prepared in a new separate kitchen especially designed for the raw food menu.  The raw menu contains several tasty, satisfying dishes ranging from Appetizers, Soups, Salads, Entree's and Desserts.  CASTLE ROCK INN 5827 Sacramento Ave.  Dunsmuir, CA 96025 530-235-0782 www. caltheater. com bill@castlerockpub. com Contact: Bill Seaberry Listen to the singing river as you tickle your imagination with poetry readings, live music, theater, dancing and delicious American live food.  ELIXIR TEAS AND TONICS 8612 Melrose Ave West Hollywood, CA 90069 310. 657. 9310 A quaint cafe in Hollywood that offers amazing raw treats, teas and tonics!  EREWHON 7660-A Beverly Blvd."
