    "fullText": "Angeles restaurant, where anything goes... — Angeles restaurant, where anything goes...  as long as it's RAW!  This is truly an experience of gourmet living- food cuisine.  KUNG FOOD 2949 5th Avenue San Diego, CA 92103 Contacts: Mitch or Brad 619-298-7302 Fax: 619-298-1559 www. kung-food. com An organic restaurant in the Hillcrest community just west of Balboa Park in San Diego.  Kung Food offers 100% plant-based organic, love-filled food, a full juice bar and raw specialties (raw salad bar, soup, deli specialties and desserts).  Open seven days a week: Mon-Thurs: n am to 10 pm.  Friday: n am to Midnight, Saturday: 9am to Midnight and Sunday: 9am to 10pm.  An organic drive-thru option is available Monday thru Friday!  After 7 pm, Kung Food hosts regular enter- tainment.  LEAF CUISINE 11938 West Washington Blvd.  Los Angeles, CA 90066 310-390-6005 Fax: 310-390-5720 info@leafcuisine. com Leaf Cuisine is a new raw-food restau- rant in the LA area serving LA's growing raw-food movement."
