    "excerpt": "In his own words founder Rod Rotondi states: \"Our intention is to create healthful, tasty and affordable foods, in their natural state, using only organic ingredients, imagination and conscious care. \" LIVING LIGHT HOUSE 1457 12th Street Santa Monica, CA 90401 Contacts: Don Kidson 310-395-6337 Fax: 310-394-2858 The Liv...",
    "fullText": "Angeles restaurant, where anything goes... — In his own words founder Rod Rotondi states: \"Our intention is to create healthful, tasty and affordable foods, in their natural state, using only organic ingredients, imagination and conscious care. \" LIVING LIGHT HOUSE 1457 12th Street Santa Monica, CA 90401 Contacts: Don Kidson 310-395-6337 Fax: 310-394-2858 The Living Light House hosts Tuesday and Thursday night raw food meals.  Don invites ecological lecturers and activists to present at the house.  LYDIA'S LOVIN' FOODS 31 Bolinas Ave.  Fairfax, California 415-456-5300 Fax: 415-258-9623 info@lydiasorganics. com A beautiful raw-food restaurant nestled the paradise of Marin County, Northern, California.  The menu is totally organic and vegan.  Lydia works hard to provide you with food filled with love!  Take a trip to Lydia's and support her and her team's efforts!  RAW ENERGY: ORGANIC JUICE CAFE 2050 Addison (between Shattuck/Milvia) Berkeley, CA 510-665-9464 Contact: Vicky Lee www. rawenergy."
