    "excerpt": "blossominglotuscafe. com Blossoming Lotus Cafe is a vegan/raw food restaurant on the lush Garden Island of Kauai.  They feature many transitional style foods for those seeking a vegan lifestyle.  Every Friday they host a Live-Food Feast.  A perfect stop for all visitors to Kauai!  A first class operation.  RAISIN' CANE...",
    "fullText": "LUSH LIFE CAFE 1405 Ralph D. — blossominglotuscafe. com Blossoming Lotus Cafe is a vegan/raw food restaurant on the lush Garden Island of Kauai.  They feature many transitional style foods for those seeking a vegan lifestyle.  Every Friday they host a Live-Food Feast.  A perfect stop for all visitors to Kauai!  A first class operation.  RAISIN' CANE Makuu Market in Pahoa Village Big Island, Hawaii Contact: RJ 808-965-5486 A fantastic oasis of good times in the town of Pahoa near Hilo, Hawaii on the big Island.  Specializing in cane juice and cacao, you can only experi- ence bliss at this quaint establishment.  Great fun for everyone!  Definitely the best sugar- cane stand and sorbet shop on Earth.  IDAHO AKASHA ORGANICS 160 Main Street Ketchum, Idaho Contact: Ananda Kriya (208) 726-4777 akasha@svidaho. net \"Nutrition for Transformation\" as the owner Ananda Kriya calls it.  He has gone the distance to create a sacred space where food can be enjoyed in its natural raw organic state."
