    "excerpt": "Modeled in the style of a Hindu temple, Akasha Organics is located at the base of the Sun Valley Ski Resort.  The owner became a raw-foodist in 1969.  ILLINIOS KARYN'S 1901 N.  Halsted Ave.  Chicago, IL, 60614 (312) 255-1590 This sanctuary is a full beauty spa and raw-food restaurant.  The owner, Karyn - a supermodel -...",
    "fullText": "LUSH LIFE CAFE 1405 Ralph D. — Modeled in the style of a Hindu temple, Akasha Organics is located at the base of the Sun Valley Ski Resort.  The owner became a raw-foodist in 1969.  ILLINIOS KARYN'S 1901 N.  Halsted Ave.  Chicago, IL, 60614 (312) 255-1590 This sanctuary is a full beauty spa and raw-food restaurant.  The owner, Karyn - a supermodel - has been a raw- foodist for over 30 years.  If you would love to know her secrets, taste her food and enjoy fine dining, this is the place for you.  MASSACHUSETTS ORGANIC GARDEN RESTAURANT & JUICE BAR 294 Cabot St.  (near the Cabot Cinema - Rte.  62 off Rte.  128) Beverly, Massachusetts 01915 978-922-0004 Contact: Robert Reid www. vegdining. com The ultimate raw experience for everyone in the Boston area and the northeast United States.  This restau- rant was founded by two totally dedicated raw-foodists.  MINNESOTA ECOPOLITAN 2409 Lyndale Ave.  South Minneapolis, MN 55405 612-87 -GREEN (47336) info@ecopolitan. net www. ecopolitan."
