    "fullText": "LUSH LIFE CAFE 1405 Ralph D. — net Ecopolitan is a completely organic, vegan and raw restaurant as well as an ecological shop selling natural, non-toxic home and body goods.  NEVADA Go RAW CAFÉ 2910 Lake East Drive Las Vegas, NV 89117 www. gorawcafe. com Phone/Fax: 702. 254. 5382 This is the first raw restaurant in the dynamic duo.  Go RAW CAFÉ (2) 2381 East Windmill Way Las Vegas, NV 89123 www. gorawcafe. com This is a great pair of raw-food restau- rants serving the Las Vegas area.  The food is fantastic and the love is there!  Visit both restaurants and experience the true delight of raw-food cuisine.  Highly recommended!  NEW JERSEY DOWN TO EARTH 7 Broad Street Redbank, NJ 07701 732-747-4542 Now the residents of the Garden State can enjoy the fruits of the garden at this vegan-organic restaurant.  Each day they feature a raw-live food special."
