    "fullText": "EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT 313-A W. — EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT 313-A W.  Water Street Toms River, NJ 08753 732-473-9555 www. eastcoastvegan. com Some live-food is found on the menu in this small town where David Wolfe was born!  NEW YORK BLUE GREEN Organic Juice Cafe 248 Mott St.  New York, NY 10012 or 203 East 74th St.  New York, NY 10021 212-744-0940 www. bluegreenjuice. com Blue/Green Organic Juice Cafe provides unique organic juices, smoothies and vegan cuisine.  Prepared daily at The Plant, a commis- sary kitchen and juice caf^ in Brooklyn, the food is created with the freshest organic and seasonal ingredients.  BONOBOS VEGETARIAN 18 East 23rd Street NYC, NY 10010 212-505-1200 www. bonobosrestaurant. com A totally raw restaurant serving the needs of Central Manhattan!  Great location with lots of space for parties, meetings and gatherings.  The inside of this restaurant is overflowing with healthy vibes.  CANDLE 79 154 East 79th Street New York, NY 10021 212-537-7179 www. candlecafe."
