    "excerpt": "com Candle 79 is a new vegan/organic restaurant featuring local seasonal produce, the menu features raw food options.  Chef Angel Ramos is always creating delicious raw desserts to top off your fine dining experience CARAVAN OF DREAMS 405 East 6th Street New York, NY 10009 212-254-1613 Contact: Angel Moreno www. carava...",
    "fullText": "EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT 313-A W. — com Candle 79 is a new vegan/organic restaurant featuring local seasonal produce, the menu features raw food options.  Chef Angel Ramos is always creating delicious raw desserts to top off your fine dining experience CARAVAN OF DREAMS 405 East 6th Street New York, NY 10009 212-254-1613 Contact: Angel Moreno www. caravanofdreams. net Caravan offers organic vegan cuisine and raw-food dishes.  Caravan hosts seminars and lectures.  This is one of Manhattan's favorite vegetarian restaurants.  COUNTER VEGETARIAN RESTAURANT 105 First Avenue New York, NY 10003 212-982-5870 www. counterrestaurant. com A vegan restaurant in New York that serves many raw dishes as well.  Counter is open late!  JUBBS LONGEVITY LIFEFOOD STORE 508 East 12th Street (@ Avenue A) New York, NY 10009 888-420-8270 212-358-8068 www. jubbslongevity. com This is a lifefood cafe serving bever- ages, wraps and sunfood-friendly products.  One of the founders, David Jubb, is an icon of raw-food culture."
