    "fullText": "EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT 313-A W. — PENNSYVANIA ARNOLD'S WAY 319 West Main St.  Store 4 Rear Lansdale, PA 19446 215-361-0116 www. arnoldsway. com Arnold's Way offers raw-food meals and juices.  A quaint, wonderful, educational restaurant located near Philadelphia.  RAW LIFE LINE Huntingdon Valley, PA Contact: Joel Odhner 800-RAW-9197 215-947-1510 joel@rawlifeline. com www. rawlifeline. com A great source for raw meals shipped right to your door!  All meals are indi- vidually packaged, labeled with ingredients and serving suggestions.  Each order is packed in a cooler box with dry ice for ultimate temperature control and sent to your door!  All meals are guaranteed to your satis- faction.  Check out the web site and find wonderful recipes, order meals, raw food products and more!"
