    "fullText": "Also, if you are interested, you can tap into my monthly diary blog. — thebestdayever. com is essentially my uncensored online magazine that allows you to instantly access the latest, most fascinating information in the field.  No more waiting by the mailbox.  All I do, all day, every day is pursue and live the cutting edge of health, beauty, nutrition, peak performance, vegetarian diets and especially raw-food diets.  This information allows you to leap miles ahead of the curve and create astounding rejuvenation and healing now without having to make the same mistakes tens of thousands of others have made.  Why am I doing this?  Because the information that is in my brain and computer is expanding far faster than I can publish it in books.  I have been perplexed as to what to do with it all.  Eventually, the answer appeared: create an online magazine for you!  This site was created to give you immeciate access to leading edge information to help you instantly enhance the quality of your life."
