    "excerpt": "Later I had the privilege of sitting through courses of lectures in his classes, of meeting him socially through a long period, of having his expert advice in my own dietetic practice, and of testing out to my own satisfaction the principles of health which he has discovered.  It is from these sources that I shall try ...",
    "fullText": "ratrod ucfion by Dr. — Later I had the privilege of sitting through courses of lectures in his classes, of meeting him socially through a long period, of having his expert advice in my own dietetic practice, and of testing out to my own satisfaction the principles of health which he has discovered.  It is from these sources that I shall try to set down, partly in his own language and partly in paraphrase, the story of the man and his record in the healing sphere."
