    "excerpt": "Ft reword to the Third dition There has been such great demand and praise for \"Rational Fasting\" that a third edition has become necessary. In the meantime, nature doctors have also released publications on fasting cures despite their initial objection to the most natural of all cures. However, they obviously still lac...",
