    "excerpt": "Once man is healthy in my sense of the word by fasting and following a fruit-diet, that is, free from mucus, slime and germ, he, if he stays with the fruit-diet, need not fast any longer.  And only then will he find a pleasure in eating which he never dreamt of before.  Only in this way will man find the way to happine...",
    "fullText": "REMEDIES 51 eat anything before 10 o'clock and then nothing but fruit. — Once man is healthy in my sense of the word by fasting and following a fruit-diet, that is, free from mucus, slime and germ, he, if he stays with the fruit-diet, need not fast any longer.  And only then will he find a pleasure in eating which he never dreamt of before.  Only in this way will man find the way to happiness, harmony and the solution of all questions, as only through this he can become want-free and get \"nearest to divinity."
