    "excerpt": "Thus all symptoms of aging are latent disease, accumulation of mucus and clogging up of the system with mucus.  Anybody who takes to a careful diet of mucusless foods in case of any disease, possibly followed up by a fast, will rid his body of the dead cells which have accumulated there in the course of many years and ...",
    "fullText": "First one more word about getting gray hair. — Thus all symptoms of aging are latent disease, accumulation of mucus and clogging up of the system with mucus.  Anybody who takes to a careful diet of mucusless foods in case of any disease, possibly followed up by a fast, will rid his body of the dead cells which have accumulated there in the course of many years and will not only better his condition but at the same time rejuve- nate himself.  And whoever rejuvenates himself will simultaneously build up his resistance to disease to a remarkable degree.  Nobody seems to believe in this possibility.  Yet, each scientific dictionary will tell you that under normal circumstances the na- tural causes of death should be arteriosclerosis due to a slowed down metabolism, i. e. , clogging up of the entire organism, and therefore life ought to end without any disease whatever."
