    "excerpt": "One of the amazing results of my cure is a remarkable improvement in the voice, a strengthening of the vocal cords.  Even a lost voice can be reactivated which is eloquent proof indeed of the far reaching effects of my system on the entire human organism.  I wish to refer here espe- cially to the tremendous success tha...",
    "fullText": "First one more word about getting gray hair. — One of the amazing results of my cure is a remarkable improvement in the voice, a strengthening of the vocal cords.  Even a lost voice can be reactivated which is eloquent proof indeed of the far reaching effects of my system on the entire human organism.  I wish to refer here espe- cially to the tremendous success that the Royal Bavarian Chamber Singer Heinrich Knote, Munich, achieved through a cure under my direction.  His voice improved in clarity and beauty to such an extent that the entire musical world was amazed and full of the highest praise."
