    "excerpt": "CHAPTER 4 Increasing longevity In the previous chapters I stated that the reason for disease and aging is the accumulation of mucus in the body. I also proved the possibility of cell regeneration through fasting and fruit diet. There- fore, if man feeds on fruit only all his life, death can be delayed for a long, long ...",
