    "fullText": "Sauerkraut is also to be recom- mended. — What can be said in general, however, and what I teach is new and different from the average fasting experts, I have summa- rized as \"IMPORTANT RULES FOR THE FAST- ER TO BE CAREFULLY STUDIED AND MEM- ORIZED. \" 1 .  After a fast, do not eat particularly nourishing food, this would he a mistake.  All meals for a few days after the fast should have a laxative effect.  2 - The sooner the first meal passes thru the body the more efficiently it clears away the loosened mucus and poisons in the stomach and intestines."
