    "excerpt": "82 RATIONAL FASTING Rules During the Fast Clean the lower intestines as well as you can with enemas at least every other day. Before starting a longer fast prepare for it and take a laxative occasionally and definitely the day before you start the fast. It is important that you get as much fresh air as possible therefo...",
    "fullText": "If you feel strong enough, go for a walk or do some light physical work. — 82 RATIONAL FASTING Rules During the Fast Clean the lower intestines as well as you can with enemas at least every other day. Before starting a longer fast prepare for it and take a laxative occasionally and definitely the day before you start the fast. It is important that you get as much fresh air as possible therefore remain outdoors as much as you can during the day and keep windows open at night. If you feel strong enough, go for a walk or do some light physical work. If tired and weak, rest and sleep as much as you can. On days when you feel weak--you will experi- ence such days especially when the waste is in the circulationyour sleep may be restless and dis- turbed and you may have bad dreams. This is caused by the poisons passing thru the brain. If doubt and loss of faith in the fasting cure will arise in your mind then take this lesson and read it over and over again, as well as the other fasting chapters. Also, don't forget that you are lying on \"Nature's operating table\", the most wonderful of all operations that could be performed and without surgery! However, if any extraordinary sensation occurs due to the poisons now in circulation, take an enema at PDF compression, OCR, web optimization using a watermarked evaluation copy of CVISION PDFCompressor"
