    "fullText": "Then the full beneficial effect of the “Mucusless Diet” can be enjoyed. — sufficient quantity are the energy and life supporting ingredients which make them the superior of all other foods, when the debris (mucus) from the “mucus-rich” foods is eliminated.  Then the full beneficial effect of the “Mucusless Diet” can be enjoyed.  Prof.  Arnold Ehret was undoubtedly one of the greatest healers of modern times— Philosopher, Teacher and Health lecturer—he came to this country searching for further knowledge plus a desire to share his remarkable healing discoveries with those willing to accept.  This overwhelming desire to help his fellow-man—to learn the truth—together with a willingness to admit he did not know it all, was his motivating force.  He recognized the necessity for united effort and hoped to avoid unpleasant consequences that result through petty jealousies.  The valuable thoughts, deeds and words of wisdom, was his heritage he left to us when he passed into the great beyond.  The magnitude and versatility of the healing art that Prof."
