    "excerpt": "I have had hundreds of cases tell me that every doctor they called upon gave a different diagnosis, and a correspondingly different name for their ailment I always surprised them by saying, “I know exactly what ails you, thru facial diagnosis, and you will see yourself in the ‘magic mirror’ within a few days”.  The Exp...",
    "fullText": "In the case of a fatty type, liquids should be used during the fast. — I have had hundreds of cases tell me that every doctor they called upon gave a different diagnosis, and a correspondingly different name for their ailment I always surprised them by saying, “I know exactly what ails you, thru facial diagnosis, and you will see yourself in the ‘magic mirror’ within a few days”.  The Experimental Diagnosis Just as I have already stated in the beginning of this lesson, you must fast for two or three days.  In the case of a fatty type, liquids should be used during the fast.  The surface of the tongue will clearly indicate the appearance on the inside of the body, and the patient's breath will prove the amount and grade of decomposition.  It is even possible to tell the kind of food they preferred most!  Should pain be felt at any one place during the beginning of the fast, you may be sure that this is a weak point and the symptom is not sufficiently developed for medical doctors to reveal it thru their examination."
