    "fullText": "The methods of healing are numberless. — This is the secret: If the body of any sick man endeavors to eliminate poisons manifested by any kind of symptoms and a new and dangerous poison is introduced into the circulation, the elimination thru the symptoms is more or less stopped because the body instinctively sets to work to neutralize these poisons as far as it is possible.  The symptoms return just as soon as the life is saved, and the same procedure is repeated until the patient dies or—if intelligent enough—casts medicine aside in time and seeks to save himself by; Drugless Healing The methods of Drugless Healing are also very numerous, and they can be divided into three parts; 1.  Physical Treatments.  2.  Mental Treatments.  3.  Dietetical Treatments.  Physical Treatments In general, all physical treatment have a tendency to loosen local constitutional encumbrances thru various kinds of vibrations and thermal differences."
