    "fullText": "Menus for the Fourth Two Weeks L UNCH : Fruits as in previous menus. — This then is why it is of extreme importance that every meal of a diet of healing and cleansing must leave the body as soon as possible.  Being mixed with the loosened and dissolved poisons they cause these “uncomfortable” conditions—a fact that has never before been perfectly understood or explained.  Certain foods prove more laxative under certain conditions.  Therefore, eat the foods that you have personally found to be the most laxative in your own body.  If you do not experience a regular bowel movement before retiring, always help with an enema, a laxative or both.  A natural laxative helps, which you will undoubtedly find very efficient, is eating a few dried prunes before the other fruits are taken."
