    "fullText": "The potential food value is not the first question at all. — See Lesson 14 and you will find that Berg's investigations proved to be the same that I found by intuition, experimenting and thru experience with myself and some thousands of patients.  MEATS All are in a decomposing state, producing cadaver poisons, uric acid in the body and mucus; fats are the worst, even butter is unusable for the human body.  No animals eat fat.  EGGS Eggs are even worse than meats, because not only have eggs too high protein qualities, but they contain a gluey property much worse than meat and are therefore very constipating, quite more so than meat.  Hard boiled eggs are less harmful, because the gluey qualities are destroyed; the white of eggs makes a very perfect glue."
