    "fullText": "Sex (Continued) L ESSON XXIV. — Sex (Continued) L ESSON XXIV.  Motherhood and Eugenics Motherhood with mucusless diet, before, during and after pregnancy is the development towards the Madonna-like, holy purity principally different from the dangerous so-called “ordinary” childbirth, with its ever-present risk of life, known in our present civilization.  If the female body is perfectly clean thru this diet, the menstruation disappears.  In scripture it is called by the significant word “purification”, which it in fact is; clean—no longer polluted by the monthly flow of impure blood and other waste.  This is the ideal condition of an inside purity capable of the “immaculate conception”.  When seen in the light of this truth the entire “Madonna mystery” is easily understood."
