    "fullText": "That is the point that everyone refused to believe, realize or understand. — Eugenics of a Diseaseless, Superior Race Using a plant as a comparison, “motherhood” can be said to represent the QUALITY of the soil; “fatherhood” represents the quality of the seed—of the germ.  A relatively poor, almost barren soil but a good quality of seed produces a fairly good plant, but a defective seed, even though planted in the best of soil, NOTHING.  Breeders of animals, especially horse breeders, know that the quality of a thoroughbred father goes thru endless generations, even spanning over a chain of “indifferent” mothers.  This is why inheritance of good and bad qualities (tuberculosis for instance) skips a whole generation.  As in every respect of life this problem is different also, and, of course, is different in the case of a clean body on natural diet.  Medical doctors and Naturopaths alike will hardly believe at all in the new principles and arguments, which I have brought out, and postulated in this work."
